1. Mozilla's root store: roots/mozilla.pem

Made by tools/gen_mozilla_roots.py from Mozilla NSS's certdata.txt (https://github.com/nss-dev/nss,
lib/ckfw/builtins/certdata.txt). The file names the NSS builtins version and the SHA-256 of the certdata.txt it
was made from. It is built into the library only with the `mozilla-roots` feature, which is off by default.

